      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature is trapped within the portcullises at the beginning of the Slashing Cage Trap's turn.<strong> Effect</strong> Each statue swings it's glaive into the area, slicing the captured creature. The creature makes a DC 21 Reﬂex save.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> Same as success, but the creature can take a Step action to free themselves of the trapped area;</p>\n<p><strong>Success </strong>The creature avoids the glaives, taking no damage;</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> the creature takes 2d8+6 slashing damage;</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes 4d8+12 slashing damage.</p>"
